<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-11-02T00:56:13.442Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 00:56:13 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Syria is actively pursuing security cooperation, with its foreign minister confirming talks on joining the Mecca defence pact and officials arresting suspected ISIS members linked to assassinations in Deir Ezzor. Jordan is engaging militarily, stopping an armed group attempting entry from Syria, striking terrorists in retaliation for a church attack, and intercepting millions of drug pills at the Syrian border. Damascus is also expanding diplomatic outreach, participating in Cairo Water Week to discuss agricultural and water cooperation, while seizing large quantities of Captagon and dismantling drug networks. The UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxOMXVfVkFlUGYya1F1S09GMzdSMnNkaE9nbmkySGFtSkNHcklPRHdQblA5aEN1WDQ5QnVWb2czb3FocHNRalIwWXEzYl9NTzRJYTFUWGQ1NGpIR09EdkllVGd5QmpmZ21pd2dWRVpEczhvT3ZQUGpPaE1vdUpzN29kdzVTVWh1Uld6?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNUnZYN3pDajdLZXp1ZVlXeF8xTDNIc04xR2tMRXFsUzZsZTh4ckszeDM0V3daV1haWE15THZRUU43QlhxUFZfLWp5Z05SQmVENzBEbGJEcHhRdDR2elJBM2ExRVN2NlNqRldidDJQdXBMLVBUc1BHY0JaZ25Yblpwd2hlRnF6ZEljb3p5d3VxVG9Ya0poeXJWZnEzUmZfclVwSTVROGdkZjJFdDIzczd3TzBja1UxUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxOeTJtNDNJcHJnSjY3clRzeTdRcWxyb3RablZoV1pPTEhWbUlBUC15WnJOVlJXSjlMRlJQejdsNDZJUEJqdVdGYVZ1Q0FiZS1Hb2RnUnVncU1ja2Ryb0k1Z2x4LVNSTkxtVlotUGhXVG1PRlJRYklqMzh1a3ZiM1gtNUpGYVFZLW5xS2FBOHFQZ1g?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxQUHFKLTc2MlFOYXhRa04xZG1sZ2FQeUhvQzlzalhmUUhYWjZseEhRTlJWcW11cy1DX3U4VkRxclY2VTg0WVRzNDA